OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle charged
OL,4,Aover possession of child sex abuse
OL,5,Amaterial
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, has been charged
OL,9,Fover possession of child sex abuse
OL,10,Fmaterial
OL,12,FThe 82-year-old was arrested in Florida
OL,13,Fafter the FBI searched two Los
OL,14,FAngeles-area storage units he rented
OL,15,Ffor almost 20 years
OL,17,FHe is due to appear in court later, the
OL,18,FDepartment of Justice says - here's
OL,19,Fmore from the statement
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
