OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle charged
OL,4,Aover possession of child sex abuse
OL,5,Amaterial
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarkle previously denied allegations of
OL,8,Fpossessing images of child sex abuse,
OL,9,Fcalling the claims "sick lies"
OL,11,FIt comes after reports of his arrest
OL,12,Femerged earlier, with images published
OL,13,Fin news outlets appearing to show him
OL,14,Fin handcuffs surrounded by FBI
OL,16,FThe duchess has been estranged from her
OL,17,Ffather since 2018 - in a statement last
OL,18,Fmonth, the wife of Prince Harry said:
OL,19,F"I am deeply distressed... my thoughts
OL,20,Fare with any children who may have been
OL,21,Fharmed"
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
